The rule according to which when an {#utkarza#}
 of a detail is laid down what is meant is that one should have {#utkarza#}
 not of that particular detail alone but of all the details beginning with
 that detail. In the case of {#apakarza#}, however, there will be {#apakarza#}
 not of that particular detail alone, but of all the details ending with
 it; {#tadAdi utkarze tadantamapakarze gamyeta .#} <ls>ŚB. on MS. 5. 1. 24</ls>.
